  "Specification": "This module is a unit-style TLA+ test specification for operations from the Bags standard module. It defines a helper operator for constructing a single-element bag and then defines a collection of test predicates that check bag well-formedness, conversion between bags and sets, membership, empty bags, bag addition and subtraction, bag union, subbag comparison, image mapping with BagOfAll, bag cardinality, and multiplicity queries with CopiesIn. The module does not model a transition system with meaningful state evolution or fault model; instead, it uses trivial Init and Next predicates and collects the actual correctness checks in the invariant-like predicate Inv.",
